# Never a repository's business. The app writes its database and its plain
# markdown transcripts into the OS data directory, but a copy left in the tree
# during development is how someone's actual thinking ends up in a public
# commit — and a commit is forever even after the file is deleted.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
transcripts/
